                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fraternity, a society or association."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b69885a-9b4a-4598-a9e4-eeba0d775391",
                                                "sense_id": "14438e2c-d31b-3168-b81e-019d960873b8",
                                                "text": "There’d even evolved somehow a kind of sodality or fan club that sat around, read from her books and discussed her Theory."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f6f3027-b909-4663-9718-73b4686e0547",
                                                "sense_id": "14438e2c-d31b-3168-b81e-019d960873b8",
                                                "text": "The story is a myth of origins, in this case the story of the origins of a sacred sodality of men in the city of Erech."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cef3dcfc-215e-32f6-909b-534ebacfc9c6",
                                        "entry_id": "117a2d30-f044-3081-a1bd-24a7f611b2f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Companionship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bcf835c-f3e1-4dae-9230-94802741fc5e",
                                                "sense_id": "cef3dcfc-215e-32f6-909b-534ebacfc9c6",
                                                "text": "Those would, he thought, be expatriate writers. He was, of course, one of those himself now, but he was indifferent to the duties and pleasures of sodality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9ba9cc3-1e3d-3927-9179-7810d3a57fa4",
                                        "entry_id": "117a2d30-f044-3081-a1bd-24a7f611b2f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Spiritual communion with a divine being; a fellowship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe6b56b6-df1d-45b6-b9d0-a0a1c330cc3e",
                                                "sense_id": "a9ba9cc3-1e3d-3927-9179-7810d3a57fa4",
                                                "text": "On the wall of his bedroom hung an illuminated scroll, the certificate of his prefecture in the college of the sodality of the Blessed Virgin Mary."
                                            }
